:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=CHGNTPA.Change SNTP Attributes (CHGNTPA)
:P.The Change SNTP Attributes (CHGNTPA) command works with the SNTP
client's and server's attributes, kept in the TCP/IP server table in
QUSRSYS; QTOTNTP reads them at each poll.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/RMTSYS'.Remote system (RMTSYS)
:P.The remote system, by host name or internet address.
:P.Up to 3 values can be given.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 255 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/AUTOSTART'.Client autostart (AUTOSTART)
:P.The client autostart for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/POLLITV'.Client poll interval (POLLITV)
:P.The client poll interval for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 1440.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/MINADJ'.Client minimum adjustment (MINADJ)
:P.The client minimum adjustment for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 300000.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/MAXADJ'.Client maximum adjustment (MAXADJ)
:P.The client maximum adjustment for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 120.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/ADJTHLD'.Client adjustment threshold (ADJTHLD)
:P.The client adjustment threshold for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 7200.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MAXADJ.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/ACTLOG'.Client activity log (ACTLOG)
:P.The client activity log for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*CHANGE:EPK.
:PD.Change authority&colon. all data authorities and operational
authority. The object can be used and its contents changed.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *POLL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/SVRAUTOSTR'.Server autostart (SVRAUTOSTR)
:P.The server autostart for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/SVRACTLOG'.Server activity log (SVRACTLOG)
:P.The server activity log for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *ERROR.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGNTPA/SYNCRQD'.Synchronization required (SYNCRQD)
:P.The synchronization required for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
